&lt;p&gt;After to save this file press &lt;code&gt;:&lt;/code&gt; and type &lt;code&gt;w&lt;/code&gt;(write) or &lt;code&gt;wq&lt;/code&gt;(write and quiet)&lt;/p&gt;
