&lt;h4 id=&quot;creating-some-shortcuts&quot;&gt;Creating some shortcuts&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now lets make some shortcuts
first you have to create a remap.lua file in
~/.config/nvim/lua/soul/remap.lua&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;here &lt;code&gt;vim.g.leader&lt;/code&gt; is name where you can assign a keybutton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;in second line you can see &lt;code&gt;vim.keymap.set&lt;/code&gt; is used for set keyboard shortcuts of vim command&lt;/p&gt;
